"Mitmiksaidi reeglid vajavad võrguülest aktiveerimist."

#: src/Commerce.php:174
msgid ""
"Your saved license needs a plan check. Install Pro, then select Check "
"license on the License tab."
msgstr ""
"Sinu salvestatud litsents vajab paketi kontrolli. Paigalda Pro ja vali "
"seejärel vahekaardil Litsents käsk Kontrolli litsentsi."

#: src/Commerce.php:176
msgid ""
"After purchase, replace Free with the Pro ZIP from your receipt. Then "
"activate your license on the License tab in Pro. Your LDAP settings stay in "
"place."
msgstr ""
"Pärast ostu asenda Free oma ostukviitungil oleva Pro ZIP-failiga. Seejärel "
"aktiveeri litsents Pro vahekaardil Litsents. Sinu LDAP-seaded säilivad."

#: src/Commerce.php:177
msgid ""
"PaidCommunities handles checkout. It receives your IP address, browser "
"details, and the information you enter at checkout. LDAP credentials and "
"user records are not sent."
msgstr ""
"PaidCommunities haldab ostu vormistamist. Teenus saab sinu IP-aadressi, "
"brauseri andmed ja ostu vormistamisel sisestatud teabe. LDAP-i "
